{
  "id": "E091",
  "title": "Tipping",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-02-17",
  "synopsis": "It is important to know the local customs when eating at a restaurant in China.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/345/e34ec330e92b359eba7210cd840b1c28fd95d439.mp3?1487187657",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "小费\n\n在饭店\n保罗：服务员，我要买单。\n服务员：好的，先生，一共80块。\n保罗：谢谢，这里是100块，不用找了。\n服务员：先生，您不用给小费。\n保罗：没关系，你拿着吧。你们的菜真好吃。\n服务员：不好意思，先生，我们不能收小费。这是找您的钱，请收好。 \n保罗：好吧，我知道了。那再给我来一瓶啤酒吧。",
    "traditional": "小費\n\n在飯店\n保羅：服務員，我要買單。\n服務員：好的，先生，一共80塊。\n保羅：謝謝，這裡是100塊，不用找了。\n服務員：先生，您不用給小費。\n保羅：沒關係，你拿著吧。你們的菜真好吃。\n服務員：不好意思，先生，我們不能收小費。這是找您的錢，請收好。 \n保羅：好吧，我知道了。那再給我來一瓶啤酒吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Tipping"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在饭店",
      "traditional": "在飯店",
      "pinyin": "zài fàn diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In a restaurant"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：服务员，我要买单。",
      "traditional": "保羅：服務員，我要買單。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó fú wù yuán wǒ yào mǎi dān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Waiter, I would like to pay the bill."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，先生，一共80块。",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，先生，一共80塊。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de xiān sheng yí gòng 2 kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: OK, sir. It’s 80 yuan in total."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：谢谢，这里是100块，不用找了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：謝謝，這裡是100塊，不用找了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiè xie zhè lǐ shì 2 kuài bú yòng zhǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Thanks. Here is 100 yuan. Please keep the change."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "服务员：先生，您不用给小费。",
      "traditional": "服務員：先生，您不用給小費。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán xiān sheng nín bú yòng gěi xiǎo fèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Sir, you don’t need to tip."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：没关系，你拿着吧。你们的菜真好吃。",
      "traditional": "保羅：沒關係，你拿著吧。你們的菜真好吃。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó méi guān xi nǐ ná zhe ba nǐ men de cài zhēn hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s all right, just keep it. The food was really good."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "服务员：不好意思，先生，我们不能收小费。这是找您的钱，请收好。",
      "traditional": "服務員：不好意思，先生，我們不能收小費。這是找您的錢，請收好。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán bù hǎo yì si xiān sheng wǒ men bù néng shōu xiǎo fèi zhè shì zhǎo nín de qián qǐng shōu hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Sorry, sir. We are not allowed to take tips. Here is your change, please take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：好吧，我知道了。那再给我来一瓶啤酒吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好吧，我知道了。那再給我來一瓶啤酒吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo ba wǒ zhī dào le nà zài gěi wǒ lái yì píng pí jiǔ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: OK, good to know. Then I’ll have another beer."
    }
  ],
